members.fluentSetterDocumentation:
/**<p>An optional nested statement that narrows the scope of the web requests that are evaluated and managed by the rate-based statement. When you use a scope-down statement, the rate-based rule only tracks and rate limits requests that match the scope-down statement. You can use any nestable <a>Statement</a> in the scope-down statement, and you can nest statements at any level, the same as you can for a rule statement. </p>
@param scopeDownStatement An optional nested statement that narrows the scope of the web requests that are evaluated and managed by the rate-based statement. When you use a scope-down statement, the rate-based rule only tracks and rate limits requests that match the scope-down statement. You can use any nestable <a>Statement</a> in the scope-down statement, and you can nest statements at any level, the same as you can for a rule statement.
@return Returns a reference to this object so that method calls can be chained together.*/

